            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-02/0d998632369e7df11106997da9a51f5c71da4d60a622ffbc0d2ed94c04da4b20"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-03",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-03` 결과: 가 경기장과 나 경기장은 모두 83,000명으로 반올림된다. (F1, F2, F3)",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 2949,
