            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-03/a59739b1865a4a9e45a364f6b2e9f4cc5719010d76af850a4bb34e32ca0e9080"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-04",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-04` 실제 차이: 나 경기장 − 가 경기장 = 400명이다. (F1, F2, F4, F8)",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 3056,
            "byte_end": 3147,
            "span_sha256": "0d18224018f5985605b166a0ff21af208f9d0453572c50a971c9ea38cde9eafc",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-04/0d18224018f5985605b166a0ff21af208f9d0453572c50a971c9ea38cde9eafc"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-05",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-05` 수직선: 82,500 / 83,000 / 83,500을 표시한다. 83,000으로 반올림되는 정수 범위는 82,500..83,499이며 정수는 1,000개다. (F5, F6, F7, F9)",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 3148,
