            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-05/2f99cf3d1c1f7c06b1f5119e5e6daf39f450efeb1d4ade79b53989542f2a504e"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-06",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-06` 마무리 질문: “그럼 83,499는? 83,500은?” 답: 각각 83,000, 84,000이다. (F5, F7)",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 3320,
            "byte_end": 3427,
            "span_sha256": "6ab4a50ff46ebbf658ff3a41a5c8c2a8bc0589a013c2c1dcdc16f54844fb02fe",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-06/6ab4a50ff46ebbf658ff3a41a5c8c2a8bc0589a013c2c1dcdc16f54844fb02fe"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-01-line-1",
            "exact_text": "두 경기장 모두 관중이 약 팔만 삼천 명이래요.",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 3484,
            "byte_end": 3546,
            "span_sha256": "f5e0c10d2b6baab0beee944e487156de1f4df0dc877219ba84249d7716795dc0",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-01-line-1/f5e0c10d2b6baab0beee944e487156de1f4df0dc877219ba84249d7716795dc0"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-01-line-2",
            "exact_text": "그런데 정말 똑같이 왔을까요?",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 3558,
            "byte_end": 3598,
            "span_sha256": "339d0d02a7436f36449e514115d55a09e67ec12ef039ac793de59e4946986ba4",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-01-line-2/339d0d02a7436f36449e514115d55a09e67ec12ef039ac793de59e4946986ba4"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-02-line-1",
            "exact_text": "천의 자리까지 반올림할 땐 백의 자리 숫자를 봐요. 영부터 사까지는 버리고, 오부터 구까지는 올려요.",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 3610,
            "byte_end": 3746,
            "span_sha256": "633a23c34064c65762c38d8a5efdcb35458d7eba899d13ce578c090ddf1b8240",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-02-line-1/633a23c34064c65762c38d8a5efdcb35458d7eba899d13ce578c090ddf1b8240"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-02-line-2",
            "exact_text": "가 경기장은 팔만 이천팔백 명. 백의 자리 숫자가 팔이니까 올려요.",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 3758,
            "byte_end": 3847,
            "span_sha256": "f13655534ca835ec97c275a528f25a1a621f6f35dfbdcb494c636d9063de99d7",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-02-line-2/f13655534ca835ec97c275a528f25a1a621f6f35dfbdcb494c636d9063de99d7"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-03-line-1",
            "exact_text": "가 경기장은 팔만 삼천 명이 돼요.",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 3859,
            "byte_end": 3904,
            "span_sha256": "78728c44e59ef2b9c4460ffe12861be45eab8af23baee30a47bceed6c13002ce",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-03-line-1/78728c44e59ef2b9c4460ffe12861be45eab8af23baee30a47bceed6c13002ce"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-03-line-2",
            "exact_text": "나 경기장의 팔만 삼천이백 명도 팔만 삼천 명이 돼요.",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "byte_start": 3916,
            "byte_end": 3988,
            "span_sha256": "c7f421fca863cf39e56b84277d64d3f2a486e3c33138c6d8faaca9d982d5e4fa",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-03-line-2/c7f421fca863cf39e56b84277d64d3f2a486e3c33138c6d8faaca9d982d5e4fa"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-04-line-1",
            "exact_text": "하지만 실제로 나 경기장이 사백 명 더 많아요.",
            "source_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
            "extraction_sha256": "fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5",
