            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-04-line-2/8be1dd44249338472e3b23c9fbde2cb0bba2f20b50f4117be48e812637014b3b"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-05-line-1",
            "exact_text": "수직선에서 팔만 이천오백부터 팔만 삼천사백구십구까지 모두 팔만 삼천이 돼요.",
