            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/fc021b378084a7b07b71b70fbd0020cfd5c30df546cbedd27071eaad94800ef5/span/evidence-beat-05-line-2/4f8a278345972814d7c61cf888b1947e83c89da2845fc0e7e765afc93ed0fc72"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-06-line-1",
            "exact_text": "그럼 팔만 삼천사백구십구는? 팔만 삼천오백은?",
